<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96655" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφᾰν-ίτης</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>consisting
				of a crown</i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἀγών</span> a
			contest <i>in which the prize was a crown</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				3.7.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				15.301
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				D.
				20.141
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Lycurg.
				51
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Ister
				60b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lync.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				13.584c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				577.55
			</span></i> (Milet., <span class="entity">iii/ii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				231.14
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Magn.
			</span></i> Mae., <span class="entity">iii/ii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.820d
			</span></i>, etc.; written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφᾰν-είτης</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(8).190.41
			</span></i> (Samothrace, <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> later, of persons, <i>wearing a
			wreath</i>, as magistrates or as victorious athletes, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				7.3
			</span></i> (Susa, <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				4224.9
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				2931
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Tralles</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.1054
			</span></i> (Rome, <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>BSA</u>
				26.166
			</span></i> (Sparta, <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. φόρος</span>, 
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφανιτικός</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				12.3.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφανῖτις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span>, <i>for wreaths</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυρσίνη</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				17.51
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ς</span>. (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαφή</span>) <i>sutura coronalis</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.37
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> a kind of
				<i>vine</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				14.42
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
